24.22
# When updating this version, remember to:
# - run `nvm install` to install the matching version and update your local version of Node
# - run `npm pkg set "engines.node"="^$(node -v | cut -c2- )"` to update the 'engines' field in the root `package.json`
# - run `npm pkg set "engines.node"="^$(node -v | cut -c2- ) --workspaces" to update the 'engines' field in the workspaces `package.json`
# - run `npm pkg set "engines.node"=">=4.2.0" --workspace govuk-frontend` to restore GOV.UK Frontend engine's field
# - run `npm install` to update `package-lock.json`
# - run `npm install @types/node@<MAJOR>` to update types
# - update the version of Node in `packages/govuk-frontend/eslint.config.mjs`
# - check the `[node]` section of the various `.browserslistrc` files of the project match the major version
